        <li class="ab-tl__item" style="--i: 0">
          <span class="ab-tl__node"></span>
          <article class="ab-tl__card">
            <div class="ab-tl__year">2000</div>
            <div class="ab-tl__head">
              <h3>HCC Begins</h3>
              <span>FOUNDATION ROOTS & CONSULTING</span>
            </div>
            <p>
              Founded on Pakistan’s legacy of integrity and excellence, we
              empower female technology graduates through professional training,
              upskilling, and career readiness.
            </p>
          </article>
        </li>

        <li class="ab-tl__item" style="--i: 1">
          <span class="ab-tl__node"></span>
          <article class="ab-tl__card">
            <div class="ab-tl__year">2021</div>
            <div class="ab-tl__head">
              <h3>Foundation launches</h3>
              <span>NON-PROFIT EDUCATION ARM</span>
            </div>
            <p>
              The HCC Technology Foundation starts empowering youth through
              high-demand technology skills, accessible labs, and practical
              digital literacy.
            </p>
          </article>
        </li>

        <li class="ab-tl__item" style="--i: 2">
          <span class="ab-tl__node"></span>
          <article class="ab-tl__card">
            <div class="ab-tl__year">2025</div>
            <div class="ab-tl__head">
              <h3>4 years of change</h3>
              <span>EXPANDING FRONTIERS</span>
            </div>
            <p>
              We celebrate four years of empowerment, exponential community
              growth, regional partnerships, and sustainable life-transforming
              careers.
            </p>
          </article>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

